\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The supervision loop. The worker proposes termination with cited evidence; Countersign audits the claim against the trace and accepts or blocks with a specific deficiency, after which the worker gathers fresh evidence and re-proposes. The hidden evaluator runs once, after termination, and is never consulted by the supervisor.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:loop}{{1}{2}{The supervision loop. The worker proposes termination with cited evidence; Countersign audits the claim against the trace and accepts or blocks with a specific deficiency, after which the worker gathers fresh evidence and re-proposes. The hidden evaluator runs once, after termination, and is never consulted by the supervisor}{figure.1}{}}
